Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.27,0:01:17.27,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}目を覚ましても same all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.15,0:01:21.36,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}何も変わらない grow up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.86,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}mirrorの私に言うの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.86,0:01:27.28,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,0)\blur2}泣いても変わらないと
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:31.03,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\blur2}I don’t know where to go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:35.16,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}叶えたい夢があるのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:39.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}あの子みたいにはなれない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:42.67,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}なれない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:45.00,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}I don’t believe myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:47.05,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}but I don’t care
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.43,0:01:48.93,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}高く飛ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:51.22,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}with my new shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:52.94,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}They think I’m a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:58.60,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}I don’t care, I don’t care, I don’t care
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.07,0:02:02.23,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}Watch me, this is me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:06.46,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}転んだ数だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:10.37,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}I’ve got nothing, but this fire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:14.26,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}I’ll show you what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:18.07,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}Watch me, this is me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:18.07,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\an3\fscx80\fscy80}I’m not who I used to be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:21.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}転んだ数だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:21.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\an3\fscx80\fscy80}They said I couldn’t, now look at me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:25.77,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}I’ve got nothing, but this fire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:25.77,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\an3\fscx80\fscy80}Yeah, I’ve got nothing, I’ve got nothing
